theorem k215UnpairAt4529Step12 (a b n c: nat): $ k215PStep (k215UnpairAt4529State k215PNum4532 a b n c) = (k215UnpairAt4529State k215PNum4536 a b n c) $ = '(k215PAtCB k215PLookupUnpair4529_4532);

