theorem k215UnpairAt4529CycleZero (b n c: nat): $ k215PReach (k215UnpairAt4529State k215PNum4529 0 b (suc n) c) (k215UnpairAt4529State k215PNum4529 (suc b) 0 n c) $ = '(ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt4529Reach9S) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt4529Reach10) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt4529Reach11Z) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt4529ReachTransfer) k215UnpairAt4529Reach16))));
