pub theorem k215UnpairMacro4529 (n a b c: nat): $ k215PReach (k215UnpairAt4529State k215PNum4529 a b n c) (k215UnpairAt4529State k215PNum4537 (fst ((a, b) + n)) (snd ((a, b) + n)) 0 c) $ =
